ind":"update","title":"v1.2 Hotfix: Battle UI Improvements & Balance Adjustments","summary":"Hello! Here are the details of the second demo hotfix.This hotfix adjusts character and card balance and improves the battle UI and the tutorial.━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━📊 Balance Adjustments■ Allies◦ Bill: AP Recovery 4 → 5, Physical Defense 9 → 8, Magic Defense 9 → 8◦ Army: Strength 24 → 26, AP Recovery 4 → 5, Physical Defense 11 → 10, Magic Defense 11 → 9◦ Rogue: AP Recovery 5 → 6, Physical Defense 6 → 4, Magic Defense 6 → 8◦ Courier: Intelligence 16 → 23, AP Recovery 4 → 5■ Cards◦ Poison Needle: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036464","verified_at":"2026-10-23T15:37:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057880-1846651706695459","game_id":"steam-5057880","kind":"update","title":"v1.2 Hotfix: Stage Balance Adjustments","summary":"Hello! Here are the details of this demo hotfix.This hotfix adjusts the balance of the Prologue and Chapter 1.━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━📊 Balance Adjustments■ Prologue• Reduced the number of enemies.◦ Bat: 3 → 2◦ Felice: 3 → 2◦ Mummy Macaron: 2 → 1• Adjusted enemy stats.◦ Felice: Strength 14 → 15, Constitution 6 → 4◦ Bat: Strength 18 → 17, Constitution 6 → 5◦ Mummy Macaron: Constitution 6 → 5, Intelligence 25 → 21, Physical Defense 4 → 2◦ Consumed Army: Constitution 10 → 8, Intelligence 5 → 4, Physica","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:13:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057880-1846651706689705","game_id":"steam-5057880","kind":"announcement","title":"RE:CHAINED – Trailer & Character Showcase (Not Live)","summary":"This is a pre-recorded broadcast — not live. It loops the official trailer and character introduction videos of RE:CHAINED ~Links of Redemption~ throughout Steam Next Fest. What’s in the broadcast ■ Official trailer ■ Character introductions: Bill, Army, Rogue, Courier About the game Bill, a freelance mercenary, climbs the Abyss Tower for one reason: money. But the “leftovers” he was hired to collect turn out to be lingering souls bound in red chains — beings weighing just 1g, who remember nothi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:55:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689705","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057880-1846651706689541","game_id":"steam-5057880","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Note #1","summary":"Hello, this is the RE:CHAINED development team.This is our first time greeting you through a developer note.Today we would like to talk a little about Chapter 1 Act 3, where the demo ends, and about what waits beyond it.We would also like to briefly introduce our team and share where development stands and where we are headed. Steam Next FestRE:CHAINED is taking part in Steam Next Fest, running from October 20 to October 27.You can play RE:CHAINED for yourself through the demo.We hope you will c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:04:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689541","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057880-1846651706680554","game_id":"steam-5057880","kind":"update","title":"v1.2 Update: New Cinematics & Balance Changes","summary":"Hey everyone! Here's what's new in v1.2.This update adds a whole bunch of new cinematics, along with some balance tweaks and story polish. RE:CHAINED will also be part of Steam Next Fest next week. We'd love for you to drop by!━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━📊 1. Balance Changes■ New Deployment Rules• Until you clear each Chapter 1 stage, you can only deploy a set number of units, and certain characters are required.• Required characters are deployed automatically and can't be removed.• You can't start the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:25:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680554","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057880-1845383656377725","game_id":"steam-5057880","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Stat Calculation, Reward & Leviathan Changes","summary":"Hi everyone, and thank you so much for playing the demo!Here's a rundown of everything that changed in this update.━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━📊 1. Balance■ Combat Stat Calculation Changes• We didn't think it made sense for base attributes (STR, AGI, VIT, INT, LUK) to be 0 while combat stats (ATK, HP, etc.) still had values, so combat stats for both characters and monsters are now derived from base attributes (base attribute × coefficient).• We've also adjusted the balance between characters and monster","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T13:58:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377725","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5057880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:39:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5057880":"2026-10-26T07:39:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5057880":{"last_attempt_